## Range Bar Animation

### Update Data

What to test:

- Trigger the update action and confirm each bar's low and high edges tween to the new values.
- Confirm no bars flicker out and back in during the update.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Range Bar Animation Update Data" name="range-bar-animation-update-data" type="generated" /%}

### Add Data

What to test:

- Trigger the add action and confirm new bars fade or scale in without disturbing existing bars.
- Confirm the x-axis grows to accommodate the new category without snapping.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Range Bar Animation Add Data" name="range-bar-animation-add-data" type="generated" /%}

### Remove Data

What to test:

- Trigger the remove action and confirm removed bars fade out while remaining bars reflow smoothly.
- Confirm the x-axis contracts without snapping.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Range Bar Animation Remove Data" name="range-bar-animation-remove-data" type="generated" /%}

### Shuffle Data

What to test:

- Trigger the shuffle action and confirm bars tween to their new positions rather than redrawing.
- Confirm category labels track the reordered data.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Range Bar Animation Shuffle Data" name="range-bar-animation-shuffle-data" type="generated" /%}

### All Data Update Types

What to test:

- Start the rolling updates and confirm add, remove, shuffle and value changes animate continuously without snapping.
- Stop the updates and confirm the chart settles cleanly in its final state.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Range Bar Animation Update Everything" name="range-bar-animation" type="generated" /%}

